OL,3,AFarage says he is worried Trump will
OL,4,Astep up Iran war after midterm
OL,5,A'disaster'
OL,6,
OL,7,FNigel Farage has said he fears Donald
OL,8,FTrump will "aggressively" continue his
OL,9,Fwar with Iran after his "disaster" in
OL,10,Fthe US midterm elections.
OL,12,FThe Reform UK leader said the US
OL,13,Fpresident was still a friend, but
OL,14,Faccused him of having "broke a promise"
OL,15,Fto the American electorate by launching
OL,16,Fthe war.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
