OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFarage says he is worried Trump will
OL,4,Astep up Iran war after midterm
OL,5,A'disaster'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe war in Iran, which the US began in
OL,8,FFebruary 2026, weighed heavily in the
OL,9,Fmidterm election results earlier this
OL,10,Fweek in which the Democrats swept
OL,11,FTrump's Republicans out of power in
OL,12,FCongress.
OL,14,FFarage, who had initially urged people
OL,15,Fto support the war, said that following
OL,16,Fthe election results he worried Trump
OL,17,Fwould respond with more strikes on
OL,18,FIran.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
